flowchart LR
    C[Campaign] --> P[Pacing Engine<br/>progressive or predictive]
    P -- "requested n" --> S[Safety Controller]
    S -- "signed Permit<br/>+ call rows" --> A[Call Allocator]
    A -- "originate(call_id, number)" --> T[(Telecom Provider<br/>A or B)]
    T -- "events (dup / out of order)" --> I[Event ingest<br/>dedupe by event_id]
    I --> DB[(SQLite: agents, borrowers,<br/>calls, events, permits)]
    S --- DB
    A --- DB
    R[Reconciler<br/>query provider for stale calls] --- DB
    R --> T
